<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam 1 (Ronald de Boer 9) Groningen 1 (Gorre 89).</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance 50,123.</p>
<p>Vitesse Arnhem 1 (Del Olmo 4) AZ Alkmaar 0. Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 5,837.</p>
<p>RKC Waalwijk 2 (Wijnhart 75, 82) Sparta Rotterdam 0. Halftime</p>
<p>0-0. Attendance 3,500.</p>
<p>Volendam 0 Twente Enschede 1 (Bosman 44 pen). Halftime 0-1.</p>
<p>Attendance 4,500.</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Heerenveen 2 (Korneev 15, Hansma 20) Utrecht 2 (Hernandez 18,</p>
<p>Mols 56). Halftime 2-1. Attendance 13,550.</p>
<p>NAC Breda 2 (Abdellaoui 36, Arnold 55) Graafschap Doetinchem 1</p>
<p>(Van der Haar 71). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 11,984.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 0 Roda JC Kerkrade 1 (Ooijer 85). Halftime</p>
<p>0-0. Attendance not available.</p>
<p>PSV Eindhoven 4 (Marcelo 39, Nilis penalty 74, 83, Zenden 90)</p>
<p>NEC Nijmegen 1 (Van Eijkeren penalty 48). Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 27,300</p>
